{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1091901-quick-question-about-descent","id":1091901,"title":"Quick question about Descent","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-13T05:18:26-07:00","id":1091901,"title":"Quick question about Descent","content":"At sekhem 10 a mummy will face a descent roll after 12 hours. If the arisen willingly drop to 8 he's still going to have a descent roll after 12 hours?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-13T05:22:55-07:00","id":1091904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ipergigio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1091901-quick-question-about-descent#post1091901\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At sekhem 10 a mummy will face a descent roll after 12 hours. If the arisen willingly drop to 8 he's still going to have a descent roll after 12 hours?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope. At that point he's Sekhem 8, so he makes checks based on the Sekhem 8 time scale (three scenes, I think?).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""